  "worked_solution": "The number is *positive* because it is to the *right* of zero.\n\nThe absolute value of the number is $2.7,$ so the distance between that number and zero on a number line is $2.7.$ \n\nThe positive number at a distance of $2.7$ from zero is $2.7.$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14145654/assets/abb34ec8ead4b1b0f2b676e6ad385d94d63b609cea76f601a0d4f1331deaa1aa.png)",
